                    "Coinbase execution blockers, plus "
                    "runtime_fanout_live_service_status=blocked_no_live, "
                    "runtime_fanout_live_service_ref absent, and required "
                    "runtime_fanout_live_service_blockers by default. "
                    "Explicit runtime fan-out live-service, enabled-decision, "
                    "and service-scope recheck refs can now record "
                    "runtime_fanout_live_service_status=ready_no_live with a "
                    "runtime_fanout_live_service_ref and empty "
                    "runtime_fanout_live_service_blockers, while missing refs "
                    "still record blocked live-service readback. This runtime "
                    "fan-out live-service readback does not clear worker, "
                    "admission-audit, reconciliation, cap-guard, wallet, "
                    "retry, scheduler, or Coinbase execution blockers, plus "
                    "runtime_fanout_admission_audit_status=blocked_no_live, "
                    "runtime_fanout_admission_audit_ref absent, and required "
                    "runtime_fanout_admission_audit_blockers by default. "
                    "Explicit runtime fan-out admission-audit, "
                    "admission-decision, and operator-intent-audit recheck "
                    "refs can now record runtime_fanout_admission_audit_status="
                    "ready_no_live with a runtime_fanout_admission_audit_ref "
                    "and empty runtime_fanout_admission_audit_blockers, while "
                    "missing refs still record blocked admission-audit readback. "
                    "This runtime fan-out admission-audit readback does not "
                    "clear worker, reconciliation, cap-guard, wallet, retry, "
                    "scheduler, or Coinbase execution blockers, plus "
                    "runtime_fanout_reconciliation_status=blocked_no_live, "
                    "runtime_fanout_reconciliation_ref absent, and required "
                    "runtime_fanout_reconciliation_blockers by default. "
                    "Explicit runtime fan-out reconciliation, "
