                    "can now record runtime_fanout_reconciliation_status="
                    "ready_no_live with a runtime_fanout_reconciliation_ref "
                    "and empty runtime_fanout_reconciliation_blockers, while "
                    "missing refs still record blocked reconciliation readback. "
                    "This runtime fan-out reconciliation readback does not "
